        "TileImage": "$($repository 1595c70e-1f16-44c1-878a-21a93cd9fb12).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,\r\rThe ICA has set up a training exercise for you to train your sniping skills.\rHowever, instead of the usual training facilities, this exercise will take place in a real life location.\rThe ICA expects nothing but the best. So be sure to kill the targets with headshots only.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.\rGood luck 47.\r\rOh and as an extra challange try to pop to balloon in the mansion.",
